# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo for everything text.
# The project is developed on macOS and built on Windows/Linux; modern .NET
# and MSBuild handle LF-terminated sources fine, so a single convention avoids
# noisy CRLF/LF diffs across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF even if checked out on Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Common binary types git should never touch.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
